 "description": "Agent Evidence reviews imported task outcomes within one task, version and date window. It deduplicates sample labels and shows failures, exclusions and uncertainty. It helps review a supplier comparison; it does not run evaluations or verify reviewer identities. No public reputation ranking, identity verification, calibrated prediction or Sybil detection. Retrieve evidence with fetch or read its example resource to obtain exact inputs. Parameters are processed remotely without application persistence.",
